ectronic-video-game-soundtrack-denouement-credits-153944.mp3","resources/mondamusic-spooky-589202.mp3","resources/yoshiyuki_tatsuya-winter-pixel-422896.mp3","resources/long-brain-fart.mp3","resources/metal-pipe-clang.mp3","resources/oh-brother-this-guy-stinks.mp3","resources/spiderman-meme-song.mp3","resources/spongebob-2000-years-later-2019-download-link.mp3","resources/spongebob-boowomp.mp3","resources/spongebob-fail.mp3","resources/to-be-continued.mp3","resources/vine-boom.mp3","resources/1khz_44100hz_16bit_05sec.mp3","resources/transition.mp3"],"createdTime":1793074220866,"modifiedTime":1793080394374,"sourceSize":789,"sourcePath":"Audio.md","exportPath":"audio.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":["branding.html","index.html","other-rules.html"],"type":"markdown"},"branding.html":{"title":"Branding","icon":"","description":"Required\nThis is required for all Connor and Mitch videos, regardless of who is editing on that day.\nAt the beginning of every Connor and Mitch video is this intro: Although it has changed over the years, the above intro is the current version as of 2026. The order that the intro happens in is:\nA funny segment -&gt; EBU Colour Bars from Generators Section with a <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Audio\" data-href=\"Audio\" href=\"audio.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">1khz Sine Wave Tone</a> -&gt; The above intro clip -&gt; The video itself.Must not be included\nCredits are only used in official productions, so do not edit in your own credits section.\nIn newer videos, we have a credits section. This is not required and is only used in official productions, so do not edit in your own credits section.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Intro","level":1,"id":"Intro_0"},{"heading":"Credits","level":1,"id":"Credits_0"}],"links":["audio.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"branding.html","pathToRoot":".","attachments":["resources/intro.mp4"],"createdTime":1793073455704,"modifiedTime":1793074600983,"sourceSize":768,"sourcePath":"Branding.md","exportPath":"branding.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":1,"backlinks":["audio.html","index.html","other-rules.html"],"type":"markdown"},"index.html":{"title":"index","icon":"","description":"Warning\nYour edit will not be accepted if it doesn't include sufficient Connor and Mitch Branding, such as the Intro. Please check the <a data-href=\"Branding\" href=\"branding.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Branding</a> page.\n<br>Welcome to the Connor and Mitch editing guide. Begin at <a data-href=\"Other Rules\" href=\"other-rules.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Other Rules</a><br>Check out <a data-href=\"Branding\" href=\"branding.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Branding</a> and <a data-href=\"Audio\" href=\"audio.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Audio</a>. Ensure you know how to use an editing software. DaVinci Resolve is highly recommended.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":["branding.html","other-rules.html","branding.html","audio.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"index.html","pathToRoot":".","attachments":[],"createdTime":1792987099683,"modifiedTime":1793080354668,"sourceSize":365,"sourcePath":"index.md","exportPath":"index.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":2,"backlinks":[],"type":"markdown"},"other-rules.html":{"title":"Other Rules","icon":"","description":"Required\nThese rules are required. If not met, your edit does not get our seal of approval and cannot be published on the Connor and Mitch Website Video must be under 2 hours\nVideo must contain <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Branding\" data-href=\"Branding\" href=\"branding.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Correct and Sufficient Branding</a> Recommended\nThese rules are recommended. They are used by Connor when editing so it'll be easier to get your video published. Use DaVinci Resolve\nExport in H.265 MP4 Optional\nThese rules are optional. They are used by Connor when editing but won't make any timesaves. Cut out a lot of silence Forbidden\nThese must NOT be in your video. If they are, your edit does not get our seal of approval and cannot be published on the Connor and Mitch Website Copyright Music\n<br>Unapproved Music (<a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Audio\" data-href=\"Audio\" href=\"audio.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Get approved music here</a>)\nWatermarks\nCustom Intro\nInappropriate words and/or images\n<br>A credits section (<a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Branding\" data-href=\"Branding\" href=\"branding.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">See Here</a>) ","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":["branding.html","audio.html","branding.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"other-rules.html","pathToRoot":".","attachments":[],"createdTime":1793079293371,"modifiedTime":1793080504333,"sourceSize":948,"sourcePath":"Other Rules.md","exportPath":"other-rules.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":3,"backlinks":["index.html"],"type":"markdown"}},"fileInfo":{"site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.wasm":{"createdTime":1793074695168,"modifiedTime":1793074645887.173,"sourceSize":23655,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.wasm","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"other","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/70cc7ff27245e82ad414.ttf":{"createdTime":1793080737290,"modifiedTime":1793080737290,"sourceSize":192740,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/70cc7ff27245e82ad414.ttf","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"font","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/454577c22304619db035.ttf":{"createdTime":179308073729